sequenceDiagram
    actor Merchant as 商家管理员
    actor User as 普通用户
    participant Products as merchantProducts:MerchantProducts
    participant Admin as merchantAdmin:MerchantAdminService
    participant MerchantObj as merchant:Merchant
    participant Product as product:Product
    participant Deal as deal:GroupDeal
    participant Store as store:DemoStore
    participant Detail as detailPage:Detail
    Merchant->>Products: 新增/编辑/上下架商品或套餐
    Products->>Admin: saveProduct/saveDeal/toggle/delete
    Admin->>MerchantObj: 校验当前商家归属
    Admin->>Product: 校验价格、库存、listed
    Admin->>Deal: 校验价格、库存、active
    Admin->>Store: 保存或删除对象
    User->>Detail: 打开商家详情
    Detail->>Store: merchantDetail(merchantId)
    Store-->>Detail: 仅返回 listed 商品和 active 套餐
    alt 跨商家或字段非法
        Admin-->>Products: 403/400，历史数据不变
    end
